{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyNgXZBQN6rMxZ4F8c803YfS"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["PENGUJIAN NTL SEBAGAI ESTIMATOR JUMLAH OBJEK DAYA TARIK WISATA (ODTW) - Provinsi D.I. Yogyakarta"],"metadata":{"id":"94BB21z5rvuG"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**DASAR TEORI**\n","\n","Nighttime Lights (NTL) merepresentasikan aktivitas ekonomi dan infrastruktur\n","suatu wilayah (Henderson et al., 2012). Berbeda dari variabel ekonomi agregat\n","(PDRB, tenaga kerja) yang sinyalnya dapat tenggelam dalam aktivitas ekonomi\n","non-pariwisata, pembangunan ODTW baru (taman, museum, kawasan rekreasi)\n","umumnya disertai infrastruktur fisik dan penerangan baru yang secara\n","langsung menambah radiance pada titik lokasinya. Karena itu, secara\n","teoretis ODTW memiliki mekanisme kausal yang lebih langsung dengan NTL\n","dibandingkan variabel ekonomi agregat lainnya.\n","\n","**METODE PENGUJIAN**\n","\n","Dua uji dilakukan untuk menghindari kesimpulan yang keliru akibat regresi\n","lancung (spurious regression):\n","  1. Korelasi pada LEVEL      - dapat tinggi hanya karena tren waktu bersama\n","  2. Korelasi pada SELISIH TAHUNAN (first difference) - menghilangkan tren\n","     bersama, sehingga hubungan yang tersisa mencerminkan variasi riil\n","Validasi silang Leave-One-Out (LOOCV) digunakan untuk memeriksa kestabilan\n","model karena jumlah observasi terbatas (n=7).\n","\n","Referensi:\n","  Henderson, J. V., Storeygard, A., & Weil, D. N. (2012). Measuring economic\n","  growth from outer space. American Economic Review, 102(2), 994-1028.\n","  https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.102.2.994"],"metadata":{"id":"ZpNbVF0Mr7QV"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Ag2vokObrtvm","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789218053912,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":53928,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"c8e02c88-dd93-4ff2-f532-42210e41075c"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Mounted at /content/drive\n"]}],"source":["from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount('/content/drive')"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","from scipy import stats"],"metadata":{"id":"0lg_Pzm1r6nu","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789218782336,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":8,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"execution_count":7,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["1. DATA"],"metadata":{"id":"__ep_1ycsSQa"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["file_ntl = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/NTL/NTL_DIY_2015_2025.csv\"\n","file_odtw = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Estimasi ODTW menggunakan NTL/Jumlah Objek Data Tarik Wisata.xlsx\"\n","\n","# NTL\n","df_ntl = pd.read_csv(file_ntl)\n","\n","# ODTW\n","df_odtw = pd.read_excel(file_odtw)\n","\n","\n","# Menampilkan Kolom\n","\n","print(\"Kolom NTL:\")\n","print(df_ntl.columns.tolist())\n","\n","print(\"\\nKolom ODTW:\")\n","print(df_odtw.columns.tolist())\n","\n","\n","# Mengambil data\n","\n","# NTL menggunakan ntl_mean\n","df_ntl = df_ntl[[\"tahun\", \"ntl_mean\"]].copy()\n","\n","# ODTW\n","df_odtw = df_odtw[\n","    [\"Tahun\", \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata (BPS)\"]\n","].copy()\n","\n","# Samakan nama kolom\n","df_odtw.columns = [\"tahun\", \"odtw\"]\n","\n","\n","# Merge data berdasarkan tahun\n","\n","df = pd.merge(\n","    df_ntl,\n","    df_odtw,\n","    on=\"tahun\",\n","    how=\"left\"\n",")\n","\n","# Urutkan berdasarkan tahun\n","df = df.sort_values(\"tahun\").reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","\n","# Menampilkan Data\n","\n","print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"DATA MASUKAN\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","\n","print(df.to_string(index=False))\n","\n","\n","# Hanya ODTW yang tersedia untuk pengujian\n","\n","uji = df.dropna(\n","    subset=[\"odtw\"]\n",").reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","print(\n","    f\"\\nTitik uji tersedia: \"\n","    f\"{len(uji)} tahun -> \"\n","    f\"{uji['tahun'].tolist()}\"\n",")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"yjsiaI1EsHbF","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220048454,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":197,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"71ef50ae-1374-4d07-e80d-c36011d9dea0"},"execution_count":13,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Kolom NTL:\n","['tahun', 'ntl_mean', 'ntl_sum']\n","\n","Kolom ODTW:\n","['Tahun', 'Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata (BPS)']\n","\n","==========================================================================\n","DATA MASUKAN\n","==========================================================================\n"," tahun  ntl_mean  odtw\n","2015.0  1.261585   NaN\n","2016.0  1.054415   NaN\n","2017.0  1.438316   NaN\n","2018.0  1.668258 177.0\n","2019.0  2.004828 189.0\n","2020.0  1.827902 180.0\n","2021.0  1.540893 170.0\n","2022.0  1.483312 183.0\n","2023.0  2.512341 201.0\n","2024.0  2.457036 218.0\n","2025.0  2.287813   NaN\n","\n","Titik uji tersedia: 7 tahun -> [2018.0, 2019.0, 2020.0, 2021.0, 2022.0, 2023.0, 2024.0]\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["2. KORELASI PADA LEVEL"],"metadata":{"id":"WUpmG1fDsccU"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["r_level, p_level = stats.pearsonr(uji[\"ntl_mean\"], uji[\"odtw\"])\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"UJI 1 — KORELASI PADA LEVEL\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(f\"  r  = {r_level:+.4f}\")\n","print(f\"  R2 = {r_level**2:.4f}\")\n","print(f\"  p  = {p_level:.4f}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"bbUcV_Y7sb3K","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220162180,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":6,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"5e26516a-fdc4-409e-ccd6-350880f74848"},"execution_count":15,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","==========================================================================\n","UJI 1 — KORELASI PADA LEVEL\n","==========================================================================\n","  r  = +0.8860\n","  R2 = 0.7850\n","  p  = 0.0079\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. KORELASI PADA SELISIH TAHUNAN  (menghilangkan tren bersama)"],"metadata":{"id":"G5WW4nGJsg89"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["d_ntl = uji[\"ntl_mean\"].diff().dropna()\n","d_odtw = uji[\"odtw\"].diff().dropna()\n","r_diff, p_diff = stats.pearsonr(d_ntl, d_odtw)\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"UJI 2 — KORELASI PADA SELISIH TAHUNAN (uji regresi lancung)\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(f\"  r  = {r_diff:+.4f}\")\n","print(f\"  R2 = {r_diff**2:.4f}\")\n","print(f\"  p  = {p_diff:.4f}\")\n","print()\n","if r_diff**2 >= 0.30:\n","    print(\"  -> R2 selisih >= 0,30: hubungan BERTAHAN setelah tren waktu\")\n","    print(\"     dikontrol. Tidak terindikasi regresi lancung.\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"  -> R2 selisih < 0,30: hubungan lemah setelah tren waktu\")\n","    print(\"     dikontrol. Indikasi regresi lancung, TIDAK disarankan dipakai.\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"2YX9Fsu7slKu","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220290381,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":6,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"34b2875f-8e09-4f2c-a952-cb4fe927c96c"},"execution_count":17,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","==========================================================================\n","UJI 2 — KORELASI PADA SELISIH TAHUNAN (uji regresi lancung)\n","==========================================================================\n","  r  = +0.6362\n","  R2 = 0.4048\n","  p  = 0.1744\n","\n","  -> R2 selisih >= 0,30: hubungan BERTAHAN setelah tren waktu\n","     dikontrol. Tidak terindikasi regresi lancung.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["4. VALIDASI SILANG LEAVE-ONE-OUT (LOOCV)"],"metadata":{"id":"nbtmxEkTskiu"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["print()\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"UJI 3 — VALIDASI SILANG LEAVE-ONE-OUT (LOOCV)\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","\n","hasil_cv = []\n","for i in uji.index:\n","    latih = uji.drop(index=i)\n","    b, a = np.polyfit(latih[\"ntl_mean\"], latih[\"odtw\"], 1)\n","    pred = a + b * uji.loc[i, \"ntl_mean\"]\n","    aktual = uji.loc[i, \"odtw\"]\n","    hasil_cv.append({\n","        \"tahun\": int(uji.loc[i, \"tahun\"]),\n","        \"aktual\": aktual,\n","        \"prediksi\": pred,\n","        \"selisih\": pred - aktual,\n","        \"persen\": (pred - aktual) / aktual * 100,\n","    })\n","\n","cv = pd.DataFrame(hasil_cv)\n","print(cv.round(1).to_string(index=False))\n","\n","rmse = np.sqrt((cv[\"selisih\"] ** 2).mean())\n","rata2 = uji[\"odtw\"].mean()\n","print()\n","print(f\"  RMSE            = {rmse:.1f} unit\")\n","print(f\"  Rata-rata ODTW  = {rata2:.0f} unit\")\n","print(f\"  RMSE relatif    = {rmse/rata2*100:.1f}%\")\n","print(f\"  Galat maksimum  = {cv['persen'].abs().max():.1f}%\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"HUBEDagvssDq","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220326787,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":7,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"425c73c9-d759-4f5b-c199-052626ee26cb"},"execution_count":19,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","==========================================================================\n","UJI 3 — VALIDASI SILANG LEAVE-ONE-OUT (LOOCV)\n","==========================================================================\n"," tahun  aktual  prediksi  selisih  persen\n","  2018   177.0     179.9      2.9     1.6\n","  2019   189.0     191.3      2.3     1.2\n","  2020   180.0     185.7      5.7     3.2\n","  2021   170.0     176.9      6.9     4.0\n","  2022   183.0     167.9    -15.1    -8.2\n","  2023   201.0     215.1     14.1     7.0\n","  2024   218.0     198.7    -19.3    -8.9\n","\n","  RMSE            = 11.3 unit\n","  Rata-rata ODTW  = 188 unit\n","  RMSE relatif    = 6.0%\n","  Galat maksimum  = 8.9%\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["5. MODEL REGRESI FINAL (dilatih pada seluruh titik uji)"],"metadata":{"id":"PYXtkqc-svhn"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["b_final, a_final = np.polyfit(uji[\"ntl_mean\"], uji[\"odtw\"], 1)\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"MODEL REGRESI FINAL\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(f\"  ODTW = {a_final:.2f} + {b_final:.2f} x NTL\")\n","print(f\"  (dilatih pada n={len(uji)} titik: {uji['tahun'].tolist()})\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"BEkr2NsWsx3A","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220393973,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":14,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"7784279e-8467-4faa-ee31-1578a693eff0"},"execution_count":20,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","==========================================================================\n","MODEL REGRESI FINAL\n","==========================================================================\n","  ODTW = 121.61 + 34.58 x NTL\n","  (dilatih pada n=7 titik: [2018.0, 2019.0, 2020.0, 2021.0, 2022.0, 2023.0, 2024.0])\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["6. KESIMPULAN KELAYAKAN"],"metadata":{"id":"7LwQscB-szlu"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import os\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","print(\"KESIMPULAN KELAYAKAN NTL SEBAGAI ESTIMATOR ODTW\")\n","print(\"=\" * 74)\n","layak = (r_diff**2 >= 0.30) and (rmse/rata2 <= 0.10)\n","print(f\"  R2 selisih tahunan     : {r_diff**2:.3f}  (ambang >= 0,30)\")\n","print(f\"  RMSE relatif LOOCV     : {rmse/rata2*100:.1f}%  (ambang <= 10%)\")\n","print(f\"  Status                 : {'LAYAK DIPAKAI' if layak else 'TIDAK DISARANKAN'}\")\n","\n","# Define the target directory\n","target_dir = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Estimasi ODTW menggunakan NTL\"\n","\n","# Create the directory if it doesn't exist\n","os.makedirs(target_dir, exist_ok=True)\n","\n","# Define full paths for the output files\n","output_file_summary = os.path.join(target_dir, \"Pengujian_NTL_ODTW.csv\")\n","output_file_loocv = os.path.join(target_dir, \"LOOCV_NTL_ODTW.csv\")\n","\n","# ekspor untuk dipakai skrip estimasi\n","ringkasan = pd.DataFrame({\n","    \"Metrik\": [\"n titik uji\", \"R2 level\", \"R2 selisih tahunan\",\n","               \"RMSE (unit)\", \"RMSE relatif (%)\", \"Intersep (a)\", \"Kemiringan (b)\"],\n","    \"Nilai\": [len(uji), round(r_level**2, 4), round(r_diff**2, 4),\n","              round(rmse, 2), round(rmse/rata2*100, 2),\n","              round(a_final, 4), round(b_final, 4)],\n","})\n","ringkasan.to_csv(output_file_summary, index=False)\n","cv.to_csv(output_file_loocv, index=False)\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"Berkas keluaran disimpan di:\")\n","print(f\"  {output_file_summary}\")\n","print(f\"  {output_file_loocv}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Eeugvjuys1N4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789220414347,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":60,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"dcf228e0-8715-47d6-fe04-d9361be735ee"},"execution_count":21,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","==========================================================================\n","KESIMPULAN KELAYAKAN NTL SEBAGAI ESTIMATOR ODTW\n","==========================================================================\n","  R2 selisih tahunan     : 0.405  (ambang >= 0,30)\n","  RMSE relatif LOOCV     : 6.0%  (ambang <= 10%)\n","  Status                 : LAYAK DIPAKAI\n","\n","Berkas keluaran disimpan di:\n","  /content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Estimasi ODTW menggunakan NTL/Pengujian_NTL_ODTW.csv\n","  /content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Estimasi ODTW menggunakan NTL/LOOCV_NTL_ODTW.csv\n"]}]}]}